                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "因为我的家里到处都是蓬～松松的，\n如果不小心把针掉到了毛绒地毯上，\n就会有点难找。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997514_content",
                "value": "因为我的家里到处都是蓬～松松的，\n如果不小心把针掉到了毛绒地毯上，\n就会有点难找。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1874997514
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997515_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "后来，我就缝了很多很多针线包，\n把针线，一格一格、地收纳起来。\n{A疑惑}不过，玩偶也有时候会躲在里面……欸？",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997515_content",
                "value": "后来，我就缝了很多很多针线包，\n把针线，一格一格、地收纳起来。\n{A疑惑}不过，玩偶也有时候会躲在里面……欸？",
