              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997516_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "蓬～松松的家有一个意外的好处，\n就是可以隔绝外界的声音。\n{A发抖}比如讨厌的打雷声！",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997516_content",
                "value": "蓬～松松的家有一个意外的好处，\n就是可以隔绝外界的声音。\n{A发抖}比如讨厌的打雷声！",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1874997516
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997517_fakeName",
                "value": null,
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "content": "一打雷，只要躲进家里，\n就好像能把外面的风雨都隔绝了。\n躲在毛绒绒的家里，让人安心。",
              "content_l10n": {
                "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Localization.LocalizationString, Assembly-Common",
                "textId": "Performance_21000120511_1874997517_content",
                "value": "一打雷，只要躲进家里，\n就好像能把外面的风雨都隔绝了。\n躲在毛绒绒的家里，让人安心。",
                "duration": null,
                "durationMap": null,
                "chatType": 0
              },
              "nextRule": 0,
              "guardPeriod": 0.0,
              "desc": null,
              "voiceText": null,
              "expressiveDesc": null,
              "textGuid": 1874997517
            },
            {
              "$type": "miHoYo.HYG.Performance.DialogCfg, Assembly-CSharp",
              "textId": 0,
              "pTimelineId": "",
              "speakerKey": "PerformTrigger",
              "voiceId": "",
              "fakeName": null,
              "fakeName_l10n": {
